              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amuswene kufwaafwi nubamasi, mumvwe. Amuswiilile numisyobo yabantu. Nyika imvwe azyoonse zili mumo. Luwa luswiilile azyoonse zizwa mulindulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo Jehova wakalalila masi oonse, wanyemena makamu makamu aabo oonse. Wabanyonyoona, wabaabila bujayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bajayidwe babo bayoosoowegwa, nkabela mitunta yabo iyoonunka nu. Zilundu ziyooenzunuka kubulowa bwabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
