        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo ipanga lyangu lyanywa bulowa cakukolwa kujulu. Lino liyooseluka abantu ba-Edomu abantu bamatusi aangu kuti babetekwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.63.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Is 63:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEP.1.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zef 1:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ipanga lya-Jehova lilizwide bulowa, lyaneneesegwa mafuta, bulowa bwambelele abwampongo, amafuta aansa zyabagutu, nkaambo Jehova ulijisi cipaizyo mu-Bozira abujayi bupati munyika ya-Edomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela basefu bayoowisigwa abo, basune abacende boonse. Nyika yabo iyookolwa bulowa, abulongo bwabo buyooneneesegwa mafuta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo Jehova ulijisi buzuba bwakuliya nkoto, mwaka wakubweedezya milandu yazibi izyakacitilwa Zioni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tulonga twacisi ca-Edomu tuyoosanduka kuba bunzuka, abulongo bwaco buyooba sulufa, anyika yaco yoonse iyooba bunzuka butentesya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.14.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ciy 14:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.19.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "19:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tacikooyoozima abuniini isikati na masiku. Busi bwaco buyoosuntumuka lyoonse mane kukabe kutamani, Kuzwa kuzyalani limwi kusikila kuzyalani limwi ciyooba matongo, Takukooyooba bantu bainda nkuko mazuba oonse mane kukabe kutamani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sifundwe anungu mbebayoocivuba, tumba acikwangala mbebayookala nkuko. Uyoovungulula alincico ceelesyo calupilingano azipimyo zyalupilingano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basilutwe baco, taakwe uucili nkuko bwami nibwaambwa, abapati baco boonse tabacibonwi limbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.32.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Is 32:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HOS.9.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hos 9:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mamvwa ayoomena atala lyamaanda aaco aabwami. Lweemya amikoka ziyoomena mumaanda aaco aakulwisya. Ciyooba cikalilo cabamwaba alubuwa lwampoo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Banyama bamusokwe bayooswanana abaumpe, abalo bagutu bayoolila umwi aumwi kukwiita mweenzinyina. Muzimu wamasiku uyookala-kalamulincico akulijanina cilyokezezyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulala uyooyaka citeente cakwe nkuko, uyoozyala mai, uyookonkola akubunganya bana bakwe muceenzule cakwe. Abalo babimbe bayoobungana nkukonya, umwi aumwi uli amweenzinyina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
